      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a0",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 826643742,
      "version": 465,
      "versionNonce": 1310185886,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787755859583,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "You have a finite amount of time to test. Choose wisely (risk based testing)\nDon't test code you don't own.\n\nMore tests than are helpful is a huge liability.\n    - Oh! our CI pipeline is sooo slow!\n    - They cement in bad design if you are testing at the wrong level.\n        - If your tests test your implementation, it makes it harder to improve your code.\n            \"I hate tests, every time I change something, I have to update a bunch of tests\"\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "You have a finite amount of time to test. Choose wisely (risk based testing)\nDon't test code you don't own.\n\nMore tests than are helpful is a huge liability.\n    - Oh! our CI pipeline is sooo slow!\n    - They cement in bad design if you are testing at the wrong level.\n        - If your tests test your implementation, it makes it harder to improve your code.\n            \"I hate tests, every time I change something, I have to update a bunch of tests\"\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "23Xi8PFpR-oCaXfYc2jXP",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 84,
      "y": 540,
      "width": 734.8795776367188,
      "height": 425,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a2",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 382973314,
      "version": 652,
      "versionNonce": 981610178,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787756436702,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Testing Levels:\n\nSystem Integration Tests\n    - Tests that run in an environment that tries to mirror prod.\n    - Test environment, staging, etc. \n    - NOT RUN IN YOUR PIPELINE\n\nSystem Tests\n    - Test that test your app from the \"point of contact\"\n      For an Angular application, that is the UI\n    - Cannot use external things your team doesn't own.\n      for example, API calls to other team's APIs have to use test-doubles\n\nUnit, Unit-Integration\n    - Only some of these - as few as possible, for things you don't feel\n      you can adequately test for the confidence you need using above.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Testing Levels:\n\nSystem Integration Tests\n    - Tests that run in an environment that tries to mirror prod.\n    - Test environment, staging, etc. \n    - NOT RUN IN YOUR PIPELINE\n\nSystem Tests\n    - Test that test your app from the \"point of contact\"\n      For an Angular application, that is the UI\n    - Cannot use external things your team doesn't own.\n      for example, API calls to other team's APIs have to use test-doubles\n\nUnit, Unit-Integration\n    - Only some of these - as few as possible, for things you don't feel\n      you can adequately test for the confidence you need using above.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "pzyyhn60CzBQ6Qp1Md5MV",
